		"HellKnight",
			"HCE_EliteMinorPlasmaRifle*4 HCE_EliteMinorNeedler*2 HCE_EliteMinorPlasmaRifleRanged*1 HCE_JackalUltraPlasmaRifle*1 HCE_GruntSpecopsFuelRod*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMinorLightRifle*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMinorSuppressor*1 HCE_DraethMinorPlasmaRifle*1",
			"HCE_EliteMinorPlasmaRifle*4 HCE_EliteMinorNeedler*2 HCE_EliteMinorPlasmaRifleRanged*2 HCE_JackalUltraPlasmaRifle*1 HCE_GruntSpecopsFuelRod*1 HCE_EliteMajorPlasmaRifle*1 HCE_EliteHeavyPlasmaRifle*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMinorLightRifle*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMinorSuppressor*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMinorScattershot*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMajorLightRifle*1 HCE_DraethMajorPlasmaRifle*1 HCE_DraethMajorNeedler*1",
			"HCE_EliteMinorPlasmaRifle*3 HCE_EliteMinorNeedler*2 HCE_EliteMajorPlasmaRifle*2 HCE_JackalUltraPlasmaRifle*2 HCE_EliteMajorNeedler*1 HCE_GruntSpecopsFuelRod*1 HCE_EliteHeavyPlasmaRifle*1 HCE_EliteHeavyNeedler*1 HCE_EliteHeavyFuelRod*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMajorLightRifle*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMajorScattershot*1 HCE_SentinelKnightMajorBinaryRifle*1 HCE_SentinelKnightCommanderSuppressor*1 HCE_DraethMajorPlasmaRifle*1 HCE_DraethMajorNeedler*1 HCE_DraethCommanderBeamRifle*1 HCE_DraethCommanderFuelRod*1 HCE_DraethZealotPlasmaCaster*1 HCE_DraethMajorFuelRod*1",
